{
    "about": "Contract between the admin's rule builder (laravel: App\\Livewire\\Platform\\Rules, App\\Services\\ParseFilterRules) and the parser's rule loader (parser/filters/config.py, rules.py). 'form' is what a person enters in the builder; 'row' is the parse_filters row it must save (value = JSON text exactly as stored); 'lots' are field values with whether the rule matches. Checked by laravel/tests/Feature/Admin/ParseRuleContractTest.php and parser/tests/test_rule_contract.py. 'sql': false = the field is not a lots column, so the admin cannot preview it.",
